      "headline": "Software Engineer | Agentic AI Systems and Workflows, Frontend, Fullstack, Backend, AI/ML, GenAI, Cloud (AWS, Docker), React, Nextjs, Python, FastAPI, JavaScript, TypeScript, SQL, Java",
      "about": "Focused on designing agentic AI workflows that coordinate complex tasks with verifiable outputs, retrieval pipelines that make large document and data corpora queryable at enterprise scale, and backend architectures that hold up under real operational load. Recent work includes integrating LLM APIs (Anthropic Claude, OpenAI) into production pipelines with structured output parsing and audit-log emission, building async Python backends with PostgreSQL and MongoDB, and shipping React/TypeScript dashboards for live data exploration. Deployed across AWS with Docker and CI/CD throughout. Also experienced in ML model development and deployment (Scikit-learn, PySpark), with projects spanning fintech, observability, and autonomous driving. Specialties: Agentic AI Systems, LLM Integration, Full Stack Engineering, Retrieval Pipelines, Backend Architecture, Data Engineering, Cloud Infrastructure Technical Skills: Programming: Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, SQL, C++ Frameworks: FastAPI, React, Next.js, Node.js Databases: PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, Redshift Cloud and Tools: AWS (S3, EC2, Lambda), Docker, Kubernetes, Airflow, GitHub Actions AI and Retrieval: Anthropic Claude API, OpenAI API, LLM agent orchestration, RAG pipelines, vector retrieval ML and Analytics: Scikit-learn, PySpark, Pandas, NumPy, Tableau",
